twf-registry-staging

Owned by Nrupal Akolkar · Built with Muse by Meta

This repository is temporary staging for the thinkwithfinance.com (TWF)
citation registry refresh; the staged files are deleted after the KV write.

The registry data staged here is citation metadata about third-party
publications (for example SEC Investor.gov, the U.S. Federal Reserve, FRED,
and the IMF). Those publications remain the property of their respective
publishers; nothing here republishes their content.
